[9766]={"Do not allow the Rohirrim engineers to be defeated (${VALUE}/4)","Prepare to Fall Back","The retreat has begun before the last trap has been constructed","Complete your work before the retreat begins","Defend the Rohirrim engineers as they work on constructs (${VALUE}/6)","The Rohirrim are quickly losing ground behind the wall and must fall back to the interior of the Hornburg. The siege engineers have come forth to lay out some traps and important siege equipment to stall the enemy, while the soldiers make their defensive retreat.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Major Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim constructs a barricade\
* Rohirrim constructs a range finder\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Moderate Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim constructs a spike trap\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minor Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim constructs a jaw trap\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Barricade destroyed\
* Range finder destroyed\
* Rohirrim engineer defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Placement banner destroyed","A Rohirrim engineer has been defeated (${VALUE}/4)","The Rohirrim siege engineers are working to place traps and target finders to help in the retreat back to the Hornburg. The engineers will place banners where they plan to construct an item, but will be vulnerable to attack while they work, and will not complete their work if their banners are destroyed."},
[9767]={"Talk to Womar","'Womar is young and untested, ${PLAYER}. The last mysterious noise he heard was a chicken making a ruckus in a shed, so such an assertion is not new to me.\
\
'His spirit is strong, though, and I know that in time, he shall become a fine warrior.\
\
'Ho, did you hear that? I believe Edric has returned and the people have set off. You should speak with him below when you are able.'","The maps and papers can be found on a table near Síric.\
\
Síric has asked for you to review maps and notes from other settlements in Kingstead to better understand the situation before speaking with one of his men.","Talk to Síric","'You bring ill tidings, traveller. ${PLAYER}, was it?\
\
'I knew of a great many threats in Kingstead, including the Uruks to the north and west, but these Orcs that have crossed the shores... they complicate the already wide front of Entwade. We will need to deal with such things soon.\
\
'I will speak with my men of what is to be done to defend our settlement, and you should acquaint yourself with the map and notes over on the table, while we wait for Edric's return. He will have much to say to Léoflad before he bids her farewell, so take as much time as you need. When you are able, speak with Womar, for he will be happy to talk to one as seasoned as yourself.'","DNT -- Players will not see","Notes and a map of the Westemnet lay strewn about the table before you.\
\
The notes are primarily comprised of terse, unsent missives to Thane Mágla of Middlemead and Reeve Fastred of Snowbourn, but one in particular calls for able-bodied men to ride to Théoden King's side in the Westfold.\
\
The map is heavily marked with numerous forces being noted in central and eastern Kingstead, and it also depicts the path of Edric's people through south-eastern Kingstead into the Eastfold. The largest threats are marked to the west and north of Entwade and the road to the north-west has been marked as overrun.","Síric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade, atop the raised landing.\
\
Thane Edric has sent you to speak with his guard-captain, Síric. He wishes for you to brief the captain on the threats you recently learned of and aid him in any way you are able.","'Aye, ${PLAYER}. Léoflad and the others have begun their journey. I pray that their travel is swift and unhindered, and I shall send word to them in Aldburg when such time is afforded me.\
\
'Now then, let us speak of other matters.'","Womar can be found near Síric on a raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
Having reviewed the notes and map on the table, you should now speak with Womar before returning to Síric.","Prepared for the Worst","Thane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have spoken with the guard-captain and one of his men and have been briefed on the happenings in the Westemnet. You should now speak with Thane Edric in the Mead Hall.","'You know much of the threats facing us for having arrived so recently, ${PLAYER}. I mean no offence, but I wish that the others had spoken with us sooner of such concerns so that plans might have already been formed. Our men in the field likely know well of such problems, so perhaps they have already begun to work against our foes.\
\
'For my part, I have heard noises about town at night, though I know not whence they come. I shall soon have to investigate those, but the others refuse to aid me.\
\
'No matter, I have dealt with worse on my own. Síric has more to say to you, so I shall not keep you from your charge.'","'My people stand ready, ${PLAYER}. I do not wish for them to delay any longer, for the sooner they depart, the sooner I can turn my efforts to defending Entwade once again. If you will allow me a few moments to say my farewells to my people, and to my beloved Léoflad, I shall find you after they begin their journey. Léoflad is a strong woman, of this I am sure, and she will know how to handle things should any trouble arise on their journey.\
\
'${PLAYER}, these new troubles my men spoke of... they are greatly concerning. I worry that the White Hand rallies for a great assault. Our foes shall not break Entwade, not while I draw breath, but I fear for the folk upon the plains.\
\
'The captain of my guard may not know of such threats, as he, too, has been distracted by the bustle of my people, but he must be told, for the time to act draws near. If you would, speak with him in the Mead Hall.'","Síric can be found on the raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You have reviewed the notes and map in the Mead Hall and spoken with Womar. You should now return to Síric to learn more of what is to be done.","Aided by your efforts, Thane Edric's people begin their journey to safety, and now the threats that dwell nearby must be handled.","Talk to Thane Edric","Examined the notes and map","Examine the notes and map of the Westemnet nearby"},
[9771]={"'¿Bilbo quiere que vayas dónde? Aunque Gollum ya no viva en esa caverna, no es un sitio seguro ni mucho menos. Tendrás que abrirte paso entre las filas de trasgos en la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
'¿Qué te dijo sobre su encuentro con Gollum? ¿Nada? Mejor así, pues implica saber cosas que no necesitas conocer.\
\
'No puedo impedirte ir si crees estar a la altura de la tarea, pero te advierto en contra.'","Habla con Frodo Bolsón en Rivendel","'Detesto pedirte esto, ${PLAYER}, pero hay otro lugar al que me gustaría que fueras. El camino es bastante peligroso, y no estoy seguro de si debería pedírtelo, pero es un sitio muy importante... en realidad, es donde comenzó todo este embrollo.\
\
'En lo profundo de la Ciudad de los Trasgos hay una cueva. Ya te la he mencionado antes, creo. Una criatura miserable llamada Gollum vivía allí antaño. Gandalf dice que está emparentado con los hobbits, pero me cuesta muchísimo imaginarlo.\
\
'En cualquier caso, me gustaría que encontraras esa cueva y me dieras indicaciones precisas, ya que yo llegué a ella por accidente durante mi aventura con Thorin y Compañía. Pero quizá deberías hablar primero con Gandalf el Gris y con mi sobrino Frodo... puede que tengan ciertas reservas respecto a que alguien vaya allí.'","Habla con Gandalf en Rivendel","Bilbo Bolsón ha terminado su libro y quiere asegurarse de que sus recuerdos sobre los lugares y eventos importantes sean correctos.","Has hablado con Frodo Bolsón","Has hablado con Gandalf","'El tío Bilbo es un querido y viejo hobbit, y recuerda su aventura con cariño, pero no creo que siquiera hoy comprenda del todo lo terrible que es todo esto.\
\
'Gollum anda suelto, y está buscando... bueno, busca algo que una vez le perteneció. Si vas a ese lugar, espero que no haya regresado allí él mismo.'","'Me aterra el lugar del que hablas, aunque yo mismo nunca he estado allí. Pero el hallazgo de Bilbo en ese sitio ha puesto sobre mí una carga terrible y me ha traído grandes pesares.'","Gandalf y Frodo están en la habitación de Bilbo, en el primer piso de la Última Morada, en Rivendel.\
\
Inseguro acerca de la tarea que te ha encomendado, Bilbo Bolsón quiere que hables con su sobrino, Frodo Bolsón, y con el mago Gandalf el Gris antes de emprender tu viaje.","'Deberías hablar con Frodo y con Gandalf antes de partir. Hazme saber qué piensan de esta aventura que te he propuesto. Los encontrarás en mi habitación, en la planta baja.'","Bilbo Bolsón se encuentra en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada de Rivendel.\
\
Gandalf y Frodo te advirtieron de los peligros que acechan en la caverna oscura. Debes regresar con Bilbo Bolsón y transmitirle sus opiniones.","Habla con Bilbo Bolsón","'Sé muy precavido si decides buscar la cueva de Gollum, porque el viaje es largo y peligroso. Los trasgos no te dejarán pasar sin atacarte.'","Preparativos para la Oscuridad","'Entonces has regresado, y eso significa que hablaste con mi sobrino y con mi buen amigo Gandalf. ¿No les agrada la idea de que vayas a la cueva de Gollum? Bueno, supongo que no puedo culparlos, pero debo saber qué ha sido de ese lugar y cómo encontrarlo otra vez.'"},
[9772]={"Place barricades (0/5)","Thane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades around Gapholt.\
\
You will need to gather wood from around Gapholt with which to build the barricades.","'I cannot in good conscience leave Gapholt in this state. We are barely prepared for an attack with the men we have, and if I take men with me to Woodhurst, then Gapholt will be helpless against any enemy force. If you want my aid, you must first help us prepare.\
\
'We could use barricades constructed throughout the town so any attackers would be funneled towards a more defensible location.'","Thane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades on the path leading up the cliff to Gapholt.\
\
With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.","Fill Thane Nothmar's waterskin in the waterfall","Place barricades (3/5)","Placed barricades (4/5)","recoge bayas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","This is a good place to fill Nothmar's waterskin","Filled Thane Nothmar's waterskin in the waterfall","Take Nothmar's waterskin and fill it within the water fall near Gapholt.","Place barricades (2/5)","Thane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades near the bridge leading in to Gapholt.\
\
With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.","Place barricades (1/5)","Bayas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Nothmar","Collected wood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Placed barricades (3/5)","'Thank you for collecting these berries. They should tide the men over until we reach Woodhurst.\
\
'Could you fill my waterskin in the waterfall?'","Placed barricades (5/5)","Place barricades (4/5)","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. Your aid has eased my worries for Gapholt's safety. If the Enemy comes in great number, no amount of preparation would have helped. But with your aid, the men can hold off a reasonable attack, should the Enemy come while we are gone.'","Thane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt.\
\
Return to Nothmar in Gapholt with the berries you collected.","Thane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt.\
\
You should return to Thane Nothmar to see if he needs anything else done before departing for Woodhurst.","Placed barricades (1/5)","Placed barricades (2/5)","Thane Nothmar asked for berries that grow in the woods outside of town.\
\
Thane Nothmar asked for help gathering supplies for the men that will journey with him to aid Woodhurst.","Talk to Thane Nothmar","'The barricades you made seem sturdy and will help the remaining defenders should the enemy attack. Your help building and placing them is appreciated.\
\
'We are nearly ready to depart for Woodhurst, but we could use a few supplies for the journey. We could use a supply of berries that grow in the woods nearby.'","Thane Nothmar has agreed to aid Woodhurst, but first Gapholt needs to be better prepared to be defended by fewer men.","Thane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt.\
\
You should return to Thane Nothmar with the supplies you helped gather for the journey to Woodhurst.","Collect wood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Preparing for the Departure"},
[9773]={"Recupera cajas dañadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Preparándonos para el futuro","Candaith te pide que busques entre el campamento orco de la Grieta Desolada cualquier cosa que pueda tener valor. Sugiere que podría ser algo que ayude a un grupo de personas con las que probablemente tratarás en el futuro.","Cajas dañadas recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Regresa las cajas dañadas a Candaith","'Mientras recorres la Grieta Desolada en busca de Uzorr, mantente atento a las cajas fuertes o cualquier objeto de valor que puedan haber robado los orcos.\
\
'Si mi corazonada sobre Radagast es correcta, esto te preparará bien para el futuro y para la posibilidad de tratar con una gran variedad de personas aquí, en las Tierras Solitarias. No diré nada más sobre ellos ahora, ya que son gente reservada y no me corresponde a mí revelar sus secretos.\
\
'Sabrás de lo que hablo cuando los veas, pero centra tu búsqueda en la Grieta Desolada.'","La Grieta Desolada se encuentra al norte y al oeste del campamento de Candaith, en una separación cerca del pequeño arroyo que separa la Senda del Viento y las Colinas de los Vientos.\
\
Candaith te pidió que estuvieras atento a cualquier cosa que pudiera parecer valiosa en la zona de la Grieta Desolada y que se la devolvieras.","'Es cierto que estos orcos son meros saqueadores, pero siguen aquí con algún propósito y han robado más de una vez. Es posible que entre sus robos haya objetos que pertenecen a las personas que habitan estas tierras. En tu búsqueda por la Grieta Desolada, busca cualquier cosa que pueda tener valor, recógela y devuélvemela.'","'Sí, creo que estos servirán perfectamente. Más adelante hablaremos de ello, pues hay mucho más que hacer con estos orcos antes de enviarte con los habitantes de las Tierras Solitarias.'"},
[9774]={"Bring the ore and wood you gathered to Goldwine at Eaworth","Collect Vale-branches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Adalmód asked you to aid the guards of Eaworth as they prepare for the coming Orc-siege.","Collect Vale-ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I need more ore and wood to provide weapons and armour for the guards.'","Collected Vale-branches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Adalmód sent you, did he? Good enough. As you have heard, I am sure, Orcs out of the Misty Mountains are preparing to lay siege upon Eaworth. In preparation, I have a task for you.\
\
'I need you to go out into the Vale and collect some materials for me. We will need arms and armour to spare, but for that we will need materials to forge with.\
\
'You can mine ore in the cliffs of the Vale. Wood can be found in the marshes to the north. When you have gathered the materials, return here to me.'","Preparing for the Siege","'Ah, you have returned! The materials you have brought will go far to aid my people.\
\
'If you still desire to aid us, I have more tasks for you.'","Vale-ore can be found in the cliffs of the Vale, some distance north of Eaworth. Vale-branches can be gathered in the marshes just to the north and a little west of Eaworth.\
\
Goldwine has asked you to collect ore and wood to craft arms and armour with.","Collected Vale-ore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Goldwine is standing guard near the forge in Eaworth, south of the cliffs and marsh, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should bring the ore and branches you collected to Goldwine at once."},
[9775]={"Grimmar is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should return to Grimmar and tell him that you have done all he asked.","'If you truly wish to help Stoke, then post these conscription notices and gather our supplies. We need swords, shields, armour, and spears a-plenty. We have had craftsmen throughout Stoke producing them for us with instructions to leave the finished products in their yards.\
\
'I need you to gather them and bring them to the armoury stockpile outside the Mead Hall. Once you are done with that, post the notices and meet my lieutenant, Huthric, outside.'","Collected shields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect shields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Post conscription notices (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Posted conscription notices (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected armour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected swords (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Huthric","Talk to Captain Grimmar","Collected spears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","There are places to post the conscription notices throughout Stoke.\
\
Grimmar wants you to post the conscription notices he gave you.","Collect swords (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'My thanks to you, ${PLAYER}! I will speak with you again when Fríthild calls the council.'","Spears, swords, shields, and armour can be collected from yards throughout Stoke.\
\
Captain Grimmar asked you to collect spears, shields, swords, and armour for the garrison.","Collect armour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect spears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, you have done well, ${PLAYER}! Here come the louts now! I'll have a word or two for them, ere they join the garrison....'","Deliver the arms and armour to the armoury stockpile","The armoury stockpile is outside the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
Grimmar told you to bring the arms and armour to the armoury stockpile.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Huthric is outside the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Huthric and let him know that you have done as Captain Grimmar has asked.","Preparing for the Worst","War is afoot, and the town of Stoke is preparing for the inevitable siege."},
