[9778]={"'After the Haradrim left Halach during one of their raids, I followed some of their forces... at quite a distance, mind you.\
\
'I saw them encamped along the banks of the Erui and a few among them had set to work on crafting crude bridge-rafts. The Crossings of Erui are wide indeed, but these men seemed to be preparing the way for an invasion. If their forces could cross the entire southern span of the Erui, the people of Lebennin, Lossarnach, and even the White City would be indefensible.\
\
'I ask that you burn their bridge-rafts and slay the woodworkers who crafted them before they can be used to any vile end.'","Defeat Haradrim woodworkers near the Erui (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Irodon","Haradrim woodworkers and their bridge-rafts can be found along the banks of the Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
Irodon has asked you to cripple the efforts of the Haradrim to expand the Crossings of Erui.","Burned bridge-rafts near the Erui (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fearing a renewed Haradrim force in Lebennin and Lossarnach, Irodon hopes to put an end to the Haradrim's efforts to expand the Crossings of Erui.","Irodon can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have defeated many of the Haradrim woodworkers and burned their bridge-rafts.","Defeated Haradrim woodworkers near the Erui (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Preparing the Way","Burn bridge-rafts near the Erui (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'As much I wish the Haradrim gone from our lands, I would gladly keep them from returning to their cruel masters in the East.\
\
'You have done well to slow their advance even further, my friend. Let us hope that this delay leaves their plans undone!'"},
[9779]={"Collected Ranger armour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Picked up empty bucket (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fill the empty bucket at Haerondir water source (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","‘One last chore remains in Haerondir before we send you out further into The Wastes. We have supplies here that would be useful to the Camp of the Host, but they need to be gathered before we continue the march. There's armour and weapons to be gathered, and water-skins to be filled. Can I ask you to make a sweep of Haerondir and attend to this? I know it is a bit menial for such a skilled ${CLASS}, but we are woefully short-handed.'","Fill empty water-skins (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Anborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir.\
\
Use the full bucket to fill water-skins.","Collect weapons from weapon racks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Anborn can be found in Haerondir.\
\
You should speak with Anborn.","Collected weapons from weapon racks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Filled water-skin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Filled empty bucket (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect Ranger armour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. Every bit of help counts, even if it's something simple.\
\
'The Rangers are now prepared to join the Host of the West in their march to the Black Gate. However, there is still plenty to be done in the Wastes before that. Gladhir and Maendal may have leads for you.'","Preparing to Move","Anborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir.\
\
First, find an empty bucket to fill with water.","Anborn has asked for help packing up Haerondir supplies for the march.\
\
You should collect weapons from weapon racks and collect armour from barrels.","Return to Anborn","Anborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir.\
\
Fill the empty bucket with water at the Haerondir water source.","Anborn requires your help gathering what supplies remain in Haerondir to aid the Host of the West's march to the Black Gate.","Pick up the empty bucket (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9780]={"Preséntate al jefe","'Obedece a Crannog en todo, pues es muy sabio.'","'Es mi Fém proteger al pueblo de Aughaire.'","El asiento de gobierno de Crannog está en Aughaire, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento.\
\
Un guerrero de los Trév Gállorg te ha dicho que te presentes ante Crannog para que te encargue un Fém, un deber tribal respetado.","'Has llegado a Aughaire, pero no eres uno de los nuestros. Eres de ${RACE}. Si deseas ser contado como amigo de los Trév Gállorg, debes emprender un deber tribal, un Fém.\
\
'Puede que tenga una tarea para ti.'","Un guerrero de los Trév Gállorg explicó la necesidad de demostrar tu valía a su tribu.","'Si deseas ser contado como amigo de los Trév Gállorg, debes presentarte a Crannog, jefe de Aughaire. Su asiento de gobierno está al oeste de la isla central.'","'No te conozco, ${PLAYERNAME:extraño[m]|extraña[f]}, y es mi Fém, mi deber tribal, conocer a todos los que vienen a estas tierras.\
\
'Si vienes en amistad, y eres fuerte de cuerpo y espíritu, no tienes nada que temer. Preséntate a nuestro jefe, Crannog, y él te encontrará un Fém para que lo realices. Si eres débil o de mente lenta, no hay lugar para ti aquí. Viaja al sur hacia las tierras de los débiles, o ve al norte y encuentra algún lugar para morir.\
\
'El asiento de gobierno de Crannog está aquí en Aughaire, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento. Retendré mi saludo hasta que hayas sido aceptado por Crannog y tengas un Fém propio para realizar.'","'Nosotros, los Trév Gállorg, somos un pueblo orgulloso.'"},
[9781]={"Golodir nods at the basket and beckons to you","Throw the wood on the fire","Idele is in Tûr Morva, south-east of the orchard.\
\
Idele is waiting for some of the apple-wood branches that Golodir collected from the orchard.","'Any one of these baskets of apples are ready for you to bring to Idele, ${PLAYER}. She is south-east of here in the village, is she not? By one of the camp-fires?'","The fire Idele is using to smoke the meat for the journey south is by her in the middle of Tûr Morva.\
\
Idele has given you some wood to throw on the nearby fire.","'Did you ask your Ranger friend at the orchard to the north-west if he gathered the apple-wood I asked him to collect? I need it to smoke the meats for the journey south.'","Idele is in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have helped to smoke some of the meats for the journey of the Falcon south and should speak to the fire-tender, Idele.","'It is my task to prepare food for the warriors when they must travel south to fight the hostile clans: apples, hazelnuts, elderberries, and smoked meats. Some of your friends are picking apples at the orchards of Tûr Morva. Go there and bring back a basket of apples, and I will wrap them up.\
\
'The orchard is to the north-west.'","'Pick up one of these empty baskets and carry it to your Ranger friend in the orchard to the north-west. Then bring back some of the apple-wood branches I asked him to gather.'","Talk to Golodir in Tûr Morva","'You are to bring an armful of apple-wood to Idele in Tûr Morva? She is to the south-east of here, is she not?'","A basket of apples near Golodir in the orchard of Tûr Morva is ready for carrying to Idele.\
\
Idele has asked you to bring a basket of apples to her from the orchard of Tûr Morva.","'You have returned already? Oh, I see. Yes, I did gather some apple-wood branches for Idele. You can bring some of them to her now, if you like.'","'Well done! I have many more preparations to make before we will have enough food for the warriors of the Falcon-clan, but it is a start, and I thank you for it!'","Idele accepts the basket of apples with a smile","Preserved for the Journey","'Thank you for bringing me these branches! The smoke from these should do very nicely. You can throw them on the fire, if you like.'","'This is a curious land, ${PLAYER}... very different than I expected. I expected Dunlendings to charge heedlessly to war, but these folk of the Falcon-clan are taking great pains to prepare for battle.\
\
'It worries me that the other clans, the ones sworn to Saruman's service, are likely cut from the same cloth. We must not underestimate his allies if they are as tough as the Men that we have seen in Tûr Morva.\
\
'You are ready to bring a basket of apples back to the woman Idele? Take one of these... they are ready.'","Golodir is in the orchard of Tûr Morva.\
\
You have brought back an empty basket to the orchard and should now speak with Golodir.","Talk to Golodir at Tûr Morva","Pick up an empty basket near Idele in Tûr Morva","'Go ahead. You can throw the wood on the fire. The smoke will do the meats a world of good.'","Idele is in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have brought an armful of apple-wood to Idele, and she wants to speak with you.","Idele is in Tûr Morva.\
\
You have brought a basket of apples to Idele in Tûr Morva and should now speak with her.","Talk to Idele at Tûr Morva","The orchards of Tûr Morva are to the north-west.\
\
Idele has asked you to bring a basket of apples to her from the orchards where several of the Rangers are picking fruit.","Pick up a basket of apples near Golodir in the orchard","Idele is charged with collecting food and smoking meats for when the Falcon-clan must go to war.","Talk to Idele in Tûr Morva","'Thank you for bringing me that basket of apples. I will prepare them for travel. While I do that, will you bring this empty basket back to your Ranger friend in the orchard?\
\
'When you see him, ask if he has collected the fallen apple-wood branches I asked him to gather. I will need them to smoke some of the meats the warriors will bring south.'","Pick up an armful of wood from the orchard","'If you would like to help out, go to the orchards to the north-west and bring me a basket of the apples picked by your Ranger friends.'","There are empty baskets near Idele in Tûr Morva.\
\
Idele has asked you to pick up an empty basket and carry it back to Golodir in the orchard north-west of Tûr Morva.","Idele smiles as you arrive with the armful of wood"},
[9782]={"'He estado esperando con ansias tu regreso, ${PLAYER}. ¿Qué noticias de Arnod?\
\
'Ah, esto es sobresaliente. Estas páginas relatan una de las mayores batallas de mis antepasados en Khazad-dûm... ¡y con tanto detalle! Tenemos tanto que aprender de las victorias del pasado como de nuestras derrotas. No hay deshonor en la derrota cuando todos han luchado con valentía.\
\
'Estos registros no están seguros aquí en Tharâkh Bazân. Lleva esta historia a Borgar en Jazârgund, para que pueda ser preservada para las generaciones futuras.'","Borgar se encuentra en Jazârgund, a lo largo del camino al este de Tharâkh Bazân.\
\
Búkk te ha pedido que lleves el relato de la batalla antigua a Borgar en Jazârgund, para que la historia pueda ser preservada para las generaciones futuras.","Habla con Borgar en Jazârgund","Búkk espera tu regreso en Tharâkh Bazân, aguardando cualquier noticia de las batallas de la antigua tradición.\
\
Arnod te ha pedido que lleves los relatos a Búkk, para que pueda conocer las conclusiones de las antiguas historias.","Arnod ha estudiado los textos antiguos de Khazad-dûm y desea que entregues la historia a otros.","Preservando relatos antiguos","'¿Qué historia me traes, ${PLAYER}? No la conozco.'\
\
Borgar examina cuidadosamente las páginas envejecidas.\
\
'Azog... esta es una historia muy sombría. Es un momento triste en nuestra historia, pero también importante. Pensé que las páginas de esta historia se habían perdido para siempre. Me aseguraré de preservar estas historias para Búkk y para todos nuestros parientes. Muchas gracias, valiente ${CLASS}.'","'He tenido tiempo de sobra para estudiar las páginas que me entregaste, ${PLAYER}. Entender estas historias es más sencillo de lo que imaginaba. El autor describe los eventos con gran detalle y una precisión increíble. Las historias que se cuentan son trágicas, pero importantes para nuestra historia.\
\
'Deberías tener el honor de entregar la historia completa a Búkk. Seguramente se preguntará qué se ha descubierto desde la última vez que hablaron. Compártele el conocimiento que hemos descubierto y dale mis saludos.'","Habla con Búkk en Tharâkh Bazân"},
[9783]={"'¡Esto será perfecto para nuestras reparaciones! Muchas gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. ¿Te han dicho alguna vez lo útil que eres?'","Lleva los escombros a Ulfied en el Cruce de las Cenizas","Se pueden encontrar escombros en la zona bajo el Cruce de las Cenizas, bajo los enormes puentes que se elevan sobre la zona.\
\
Deberían recogerse escombros de piedra para las reparaciones de los cimientos de las Profundidades Llameantes.","Escombros recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los puentes de las Profundidades Llameantes necesitan ser reparados. Los enanos están encontrando escasez de fuentes cercanas de piedra para completar este trabajo.","Recoge escombros en las profundidades de las Profundidades Llameantes, bajo el Cruce de las Cenizas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los puentes de las Profundidades Llameantes son de suma importancia para nosotros, y debemos asegurarnos de que sigan siendo funcionales y se mantengan intactos. Hemos comenzado un proyecto para restaurarlos, pero nos estamos quedando sin recursos.\
\
'El recurso principal es la piedra. Si reúnes suficientes escombros, podremos reducirlos al tamaño que necesitamos. Busca en la zona bajo el Cruce de las Cenizas, bajo los enormes puentes que se elevan sobre la zona.'","Preservar los puentes","Ulfied está en el Cruce de las Cenizas, en la parte occidental de las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Deberías entregarle los escombros que has recogido.","Los puentes de las Profundidades Llameantes necesitan ser reparados. Los enanos están encontrando escasez de fuentes cercanas de piedra para completar este trabajo.\
\
Debería haber abundantes escombros en la zona bajo el Cruce de las Cenizas, bajo los enormes puentes que se alzan sobre la zona."},
[9784]={"Defeated Orc scouts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Langfrith, of the Elfward, has scouted a tribe of Orcs rallying within the mountain passes to the east and worries that Faldham will be surrounded when the anticipated siege begins.","Langfrith prepares outside the mead hall of Faldham, west of the mountain pass.\
\
Langfrith is expecting news of your infiltration of the Orc camp.","Pressed from All Sides","Defeat Orc defilers at the camp to the east (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Orc tribe has been scouted along the south-east pass leading into the mountains.\
\
Langfrith has asked you to drive back the Orcs encroaching on the lands south-east of Faldham.","Defeated Orc ravagers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Nink-hai seem shaken by our unexpected interference. I expected the Orcs to retaliate, but they seem satisfied to have shrunk back into the mountains beyond our watch. Perhaps they had not expected such strong resistance from the residents of Faldham.\
\
'Fine work, ${PLAYER}. This will be one less opponent to concern ourselves with in the coming hours.'","Defeated Orc defilers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Orc scouts at the camp to the east (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Elfward alone must defend the people of Faldham. Reeve Athelward sits fortified to the north, unwilling to send aid to us, and the people under Thane Mildrith's watch have been trampled in the wake of the Orcs heading west. When their wicked blades turn towards Faldham, it will come from the north and from the west. My thoughts dwell ever in a different direction, I look towards a danger from the east.\
\
'We have seen much activity of Orcs in the mountain passes leading towards the East Wall. I fear these Orcs plan to ambush our flanks when the force from the north approaches. We cannot allow ourselves to become surrounded. Strike against the Orcs that dwell along the pass to the east, and we shall observe how they respond.'","Speak to Langfrith about the Nink-hai Orcs","Defeat Orc ravagers at the camp to the east (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9786]={"There are only unremarkable Orc-tools in this crate","Talk to the bound Rohirrim","There is a crate near Frithstan in the western Orc-encampment.\
\
Frithstan would you like to search the nearby crate for a set of keys.","Search the crate near Frithstan","Search the Orc-camp for evidence of the lost warriors","Frithstan is bound to a pole among the Orc-tribe in the western Wailing Hills.\
\
Speaking with Frithstan may reveal the fate of the missing Rohirrim.","'An Orc you are not, and you are no Rohirrim...so who are you and what are you doing here? You say Penda sent you?\
\
'Oh, thank you! I am Frithstan. My men and I were captured by the Orcs when we launched an assault against them. \
\
'Look in the crate to my left and search for the Orc's key-ring.'","You have found a set of rusty iron keys. You should show them to Frithstan","Penda fears for the fate of his missing allies. He now believes that they have battled into the territory of the Orcs who dwell in the mountain-caves.","'Search the Mor-hai camp thoroughly, there must be something there worth finding.'","'The keys! You have found them! If I don such shackles never again, it will be too soon.\
\
'Thankful am I for the pride of these Orcs. They were quite ill-prepared for your attempted rescue. It is shameful to have been captured by such beasts, but I am truly grateful for my release.'","Pressing Onward","The Orcs dwell near the mountains to the north-west of Penda's camp.\
\
Penda has requested a search for evidence of his campmate's presence among the tents and crates of the Orc-tribe.","Frithstan remains bound in the western Orc-encampment in the Wailing Hills.\
\
You have found the keys that he has asked you to look for.","You have encountered a warrior who has been taken captive","Talk to Frithstan and release him from his shackles","'Brave and skilled are the men under Frithstan, but they are no match for the sheer numbers of the Orc-horde. I fear that it may already be too late to aid them, but I must know for certain.\
\
'If you have the courage, I would ask you to press onward into the territory of the Mountain-orcs to search for signs of my companions. Look among the Orc-tents and supply-crates for their belongings or for other evidence of their presence.'"},
[9787]={"'¡Acabo de recorrer el Recinto del Festival y sabes lo que vi? ¡Mis ojos decepcionados contemplaron juerguistas sedientos por todos lados! ¡No hay Festival de Primavera que pueda disfrutarse sin las deliciosas notas de un buen vino de primavera! Te daré algunas Hojas de Primavera si recoges jarras de vino de primavera de las mesas centrales y las llevas a las mesas de los bordes, ${PLAYER}!'","'¡Puedo ver que tus entregas fueron muy bien recibidas, ${PLAYER}! Te has ganado estas Hojas de Primavera, y de paso me has dado un gran alivio.\
\
'Espero que todos se estén divirtiendo ahora. Y cuando vuelvan a tener sed, siempre hará falta alguien dispuesto a llevarles lo que necesitan, ¡así que pasa a verme de vez en cuando, mi útil ${PLAYER:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}!'","El vino de primavera siempre es apreciado","El vino de primavera es muy apreciado","¡Juerguistas Sedientos!","Arn Juncoso teme que los juerguistas del Festival de Primavera estén sedientos y no disfruten realmente de las actividades a menos que sus bebidas sean reabastecidas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Recoge vino para la mesa del sureste","Recoge vino para la mesa del suroeste","Recoge vino para la mesa del noreste","Jarras de vino de primavera pueden encontrarse en las mesas centrales del Recinto del Festival.\
\
Arn Juncoso te pidió que llevaras jarras de vino a las mesas ubicadas en los bordes del Recinto.","Arn Juncoso espera escuchar si tus entregas de vino llevaron alivio a los juerguistas sedientos.","Jarras de vino de primavera pueden encontrarse en las mesas del centro del Recinto del Festival.\
\
Arn Juncoso te pidió que llevaras jarras de vino a las mesas ubicadas en los bordes del Recinto.","Habla con Arn Juncoso en el Recinto del Festival"},
[9788]={"Previniendo un asesinato","El laberinto de trigo de Wistmead se encuentra en el espacio del Festival de la Cosecha de Wistmead.\
\
Ermentrude Henoloma te ha pedido que ahuyentes a los cuervos exasperantes.","Ermentrude Henoloma, la maestra del laberinto de Wistmead, te ha pedido que ahuyentes a los corbeaux exasperantes dentro de las paredes de trigo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","'¡Gracias! Espero que esos cuervos exasperantes no vuelvan.'","'Oh, hay corbeaux exasperantes por todo el campo de trigo. Ahuyéntalos si estás allí. Con todo su graznido, parece que se están riendo de nosotros!'","El laberinto de trigo de Wistmead se encuentra en el espacio del Festival de la Cosecha de Wistmead.\
\
Deberías hablar con Ermentrude Henoloma en la entrada del laberinto de trigo.","Ahuyenta a los cuervos exasperantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Ermentrude Henoloma","Cuervos ahuyentados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9789]={"Brogdagnir está en Tinnudir, al oeste de Tham Nambarth.\
\
Brogdagnir estará complacido de oír que las ruinas que pertenecen a su familia están ahora vacías.","Los alces han invadido Tham Nambarth y pronto atraerán a depredadores más grandes.","'Aunque me apena pedirte esto, los alces deben ser ahuyentados a la fuerza de Tham Nambarth, por cualquier medio necesario.'","Tham Nambarth está al este de Tinnudir.\
\
nBrogdagnir te ha pedido que te aventures en Tham Nambarth y ahuyentes a los alces que habitan allí.","Alces derrotados en Tham Nambarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Así que, ¿está hecho? Es una pena que esas criaturas tuvieran que perecen, pues no conocían el problema que hubieran traído a esas ruinas.'","Presa y depredador","'Tham Nambarth es donde una vez residió mi familia, en una época lejana. Me entristece verlo en tal estado de abandono, aunque está entre los dominios más bellos de las colinas.\
\
'Ahora está bajo amenaza, aunque debido a un elemento que en sí mismo no es amenazador. Una manada de alces se ha asentado dentro de sus muros. No son un problema por sí mismos, aunque pronto atraerán a depredadores. Lobos, saqueadores hambrientos, huargos y trasgos de las colinas del norte.\
\
'Para que Tham Nambarth sea seguro, debe mantenerse vacío. Ve hasta allí y derrota a los alces que encontrarás en su interior. Es la única forma de que las ruinas perduren.'","Derrota alces en Tham Nambarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9790]={"Agatha Valleverde se encuentra cerca del Pabellón de Caza de Bree, al final del Callejón Embrujado en Bree.\
\
Debes regresar con Agatha Valleverde con noticias de tu éxito.","Agatha Valleverde habló de varias criaturas malignas que acechan los túmulos de Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn.","Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn están ubicados en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del sur.\
\
Agatha Valleverde te pidió que buscaras a una de estas tres criaturas —Brishzel el barghest, el espíritu maligno Faegfaer o Fergandir el hombre demacrado— y le dieras descanso.","Brishzel Derrotado","'Gracias por hacer este servicio para la gente de Bree.\
\
'Si regresas a Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham o Haudh Nogbenn, por favor ven a verme antes de volver. Puede que te pida que busques otros horrores que acechan los pasillos de los túmulos.'","Fergandir Derrotado","Derrota a Brishzel, Faegfaer o Fergandir en Haudh Iarchith.","'En los oscuros recovecos de Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn hay muchas criaturas malignas que rondan los túmulos, pero hay tres en particular de las que debes cuidarte. Las tres criaturas son Brishzel el barghest, el espíritu maligno Faegfaer y Fergandir el hombre demacrado.\
\
'Si viajas con un grupo de amigos a Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn y eliminas a cualquiera de estas criaturas, los cazadores de Bree te estarán en deuda.\
\
'Puedes encontrar las entradas a Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del sur.'","Habla con Agatha Valleverde en Bree.","Faegfaer Derrotado","'Da caza a las criaturas malignas que habitan en Haudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham y Haudh Nogbenn y dales descanso.'","Presas en la oscuridad"},
[9792]={"Collect from Râhal scoundrel","You have managed to collect debts from some of the Corsairs in the Gut. This should help Zadok make a respectable getaway.","'My money! You managed to get some of it back, and there is even some interest on top of it.\
\
'You either took more than what was owed, or these people are familiar with the concept of loans after all.\
\
'Perhaps I should rethink my business model rather than running away with my tail tucked between my legs.\
\
'Thank you, traveller!'","Zadok has asked you to help him collect on a few debts so that he can at least have enough to return to Gondor.\
\
Zadok's clients can be found wandering around Black Anchor, and the Baths.","'What do you want?\
\
'I am at my wit's end. I cannot possibly make up for all the money I have lost. I thought this city and a new clientele would help me make big profits as a money-lender, but these ruffians don't understand lending terms or even the notion of paying back what's borrowed!\
\
'In addition, they extort me constantly for more hand-outs. If I am to make it out of here and start over, I'll need help with collecting debts from these low-lifes.\
\
'Could I hire you to be my muscle and perhaps intimidate a few of my clients into paying their debts?'","Principled Interest","Zadok hoped to turn money lending into a profitable venture in a new city. Umbar, it seems, was not that city.","Collect from Râhal lazy-body","Talk to Zadok","Collect from Râhal drunkard"},
[9793]={"Zadok has re-organized his business efforts in Umbar. Perhaps he can make it work after all.","Confront the successful proprietor","Zadok has asked you to help him collect a debt from a respectable proprietor in the Gut.","'Perfect! It's even in the same chest in which he hauled it away.\
\
'This man was obviously quite the businessman. It seems he was able to make some money on top of the initial investment that I made.\
\
'I can't thank you enough, traveller. Perhaps one day I will be lucky enough to serve your needs. Of course you are entitled to a massive discount on interest.'","You have bested the successful proprietor. You are free to collect his treasures.","'You want my money? Do you know who you are talking to?\
\
'You have made a big mistake this day! No one touches my money but me!'","'I have been thinking about how I could actually make a profit here in Umbar.\
\
'Sure, the usual clientele are not used to the notion of debts, but with your help, I can set an example in the city and perhaps even The Gut!\
\
'There is a proprietor here who took out a massive loan in hopes of striking it rich, same as me. They have a healthy reputation in the Gut. If we could set an example with such a figure, debts would surely be paid on time and with interest.'","Principled Interest Part 2","Talk to Zadok","Recoge el cofre del tesoro","You have the money that was promised to Zadok. You should return it to him."},
[9794]={"'Mi madre me ha enviado a buscarte, ${PLAYER}, y NO está contenta. Está bastante seguro de que has tenido algo que ver con esto... ¡y ahora veo que tiene razón!\
\
'Será mejor que vayas a verla.'","Habla con Camelia en la calle Aguamiel y completa 'Escondiendo las pruebas'","'No sé qué puede estar pasando, ${PLAYER}, pero creo que es muy curioso que fueras la última persona en hablar con Griffo y Esmeralda antes de que se marcharan. Bueno, no es particularmente extraño por Caléndula, ¿pero esos dos? Algo está pasando, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Angélica está muy disgustada porque su gran día ha sido arruinado. Si sabes algo sobre esto, ¡espero que lo arregles!'","Prisa Boffin está dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, y te ha pedido que hables con ella. Oh-oh.","Prisca Boffin te ha pedido que colabores con Dinodas y Camelia para reparar el daño que se ha hecho a la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de Angélica.","'Angélica está muy disgustada porque su gran día ha sido arruinado. Si sabes algo sobre esto, ¡espero que lo arregles!'","Prisca Boffin está dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel, esperando escuchar que has reparado el daño hecho a la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de Angélica.","Prisca Boffin, matriarca del clan Boffin, no está contenta con que la fiesta de inauguración de la casa de su hija haya sido arruinada... ¡y te hace responsable de ello!","'Mi madre está bastante segura de que has tenido que ver con esto... ¡y ahora veo que tiene razón!\
\
'Será mejor que vayas a verla.'","'Todavía no sé qué has tenido que ver con esta situación, ${PLAYER}, pero parece que has hecho lo correcto. Soy un hobbit de palabra: te perdono por tu parte en todo esto... cualquiera que fuese.'","Prisca está inquieta","Habla con Dinodas en la calle Aguamiel y completa 'Boffins sueltos'","Habla con Prisca Boffin dentro del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel"},
[9795]={"Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner can be found at Grúmachath in Câr Bronach.\
\
After capturing a Dourhand warrior, Mézto hopes to undermine the Iron Crown. You should find Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath.","'Oh, he'll talk to you, will he? Bah!'","Aid Rethvárd with 'Best-laid Plans: Skáilag'","Prisoner of the Zhélruka","Skálo can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
After returning from the tasks Rethvárd set for you, you have found Skálo wounded and Rethvárd is nowhere to be found. You should talk to Skálo.","A wounded Skálo lays beside a now-barren post. Rethvárd has escaped!","Aid Rethvárd with 'Best-laid Plans: Toll Oivas'","'If you wish to aid us, ${PLAYER}, perhaps you should first speak to Skálo. We were fortunate enough to capture one of the Dourhands when we first laid siege to Grúmachath, but he has proven... strong-willed.\
\
'It is certain he knows at least some of the plans the Iron Crown has for Mount Gundabad, and we must know what he knows!\
\
'In the meantime, I shall speak with Múta about our next course of action against the Iron Crown. She is quite clever... for one of the cousins of the Kámbrada!\
\
'Skálo and the prisoner are just over yonder. Go on!'","Talk to Skálo at Grúmachath","Your efforts have done much to hinder the Iron Crown's presence at Toll Oivas!","'Ah, ${PLAYER}. Our paths cross at last!'\
\
Rethvárd chuckles to himself.\
\
'Lord Brathar told us all about you—how you and the Longbeards slew Skorgrím at Gabilazan. A compelling tale, to be sure, but I knew better. That thing was not Skorgrím! It was the sorcery of Angmar given flesh!\
\
'When I told Lord Brathar the truth of it, his fury could hardly be contained. At first, he could not believe it, but as Angmar grew weaker in the absence of its steward, he saw the Angmarim for what they truly were: power-hungry lickspittles that rob and abuse all peoples they deem inferior.\
\
'We may appear to serve the Iron Crown, but only until our vengeance is done. In truth, we Dourhands ought to thank you for returning our king of old to rest!\
\
'And so, I offer you a gift in good faith—a gift of information.'","Find Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath","After capturing a Dourhand, the Zhélruka at Grúmachath seek to undermine the Iron Crown in Câr Bronach.","Rethvárd can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
You have aided Rethvárd and hindered the Iron Crown in their efforts to raise the Dead of Câr Bronach. You should return to Rethvárd at Grúmachath.","As Skálo looks on, the Dourhand warrior strains against his shackles","Skálo can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
You have found Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath. You should talk to Skálo.","Talk to Rethvárd at Grúmachath","Rethvárd can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
After finding little success questioning his prisoner, Skálo has invited you to speak to Rethvárd. You should talk to Rethvárd.","'Clever rat!\
\
'Rethvárd must have freed himself while I was not looking. He caught me unawares when I brought him bread. Dourhands must truly have no shame!\
\
'Was what he told you true at least? Of Skáilag? Of Toll Oivas? Have you made the Iron Crown suffer?'\
\
You tell Skálo that you managed to defeat powerful Angmarim and put an end to their plans.\
\
'At least not all of it was lies then! But, I fear our problems are just beginning....'","'Mézto sent you, did he?\
\
'This one hasn't given me much, aside from his name: Rethvárd. Of course, I haven't been as... convincing as I would like to be!'\
\
Skálo glares at Rethvárd.\
\
'You are free to speak to him, ${PLAYER}, but I would not expect him to answer. If he continues to hold his tongue, I have other ways of making him talk!'","Your efforts have done much to hinder the Iron Crown's presence at Skáilag!","Rethvárd can be found at Grúmachath.\
\
In exchange for your aid in revealing the treachery of Angmar to the Dourhands, Rethvárd has offered you information about the Iron Crown. You should talk to Rethvárd and aid him with his tasks."},
[9796]={"Prisoners in Silk","'We have lost a fair few Subuzûri to the spiders near here. We could use your help in retrieving those still alive, if you're willing.\
\
'We have long clashed with the Ordâkhai to the south. But they are not the only threat in these accursed mountains.\
\
'There are spiders in the caves to the south-west. We have lost two patrols in the past day. We sent a rescue party, which was itself lost in the caves.\
\
'These spiders are stronger, larger, and more fierce than any I have seen before. I know you to be a fierce fighter. Would you aid in rescuing our warriors?'","Return to Numûru in Ingar-garâsh with news of your victory.","'This is joyous news indeed! I feared this to be a burial, but seeing them alive restores my spirit.'","Find the entrance to the caves of Jâr Obadal. Jâr Obadal can be found south-west of Ingar-garâsh.","Numûru has requested your aid in rescuing Subuzûri taken by the spiders at the nearby cave of Jâr Obadal.","Derrota a las arañas en Jâr Obadal (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rescued trapped Subuzûri (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Find the entrance to the caves of Jâr Obadal","Return to Numûru in Ingar-garâsh","Defeat spiders and search for missing Subuzûri warriors in Jâr Obadal.","Rescue trapped Subuzûri in cocoons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9798]={"'I do not know what to make of this, my friend. To what end have the Southrons surrendered? What drove them to such a decision?\
\
'I have separated most of them among my men, and they are kept under guard. I sought to speak with them when first we arrived at Aelin Veren, but they remained silent.  It seems that neither we nor the Southrons know how best to proceed.\
\
'Perhaps they would think differently of you, ${PLAYER}...\
\
'I would ask you to speak to them, question their purpose in Ithilien, and see if we cannot discover what led to their surrender.\
\
'Would you do this for us, my friend?'","Question the Haradrim prisoners at Aelin Veren (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Questioned the Haradrim prisoners at Aelin Veren (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The Haradrim prisoners can be found at Aelin Veren, in North Ithilien.\
\
Maendal has asked you to question the Haradrim prisoners and learn the reason for their surrender.","Prisoners of War","'Through your efforts, we have learned of the Southron's purpose in their surrender. It was a wise decision, regardless of our past encounters with their people, and I am glad their... war-master came to such a conclusion without further bloodshed.\
\
'I am not certain we could have resolved this peacefully without your aid.\
\
'Now, we have upheld our half of the bargain, and I would expect them to do the same.'","Talk to Maendal","Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren, in North Ithilien.\
\
You have spoken to the prisoners and while not all of them cooperated, you feel that some measure of understanding has been reached for the moment. You should speak to Maendal.","Never before known to yield in battle, a party of Haradrim have surrendered to the Rangers of Ithilien for reasons that remain unclear."},
[9799]={"Free imprisoned Stout-axes from the dungeons of Barad-dûr (0/8)","Freed imprisoned Stout-axes from the dungeons of Barad-dûr (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","After seventy-eight long years, you have freed the Stout-axes from their imprisonment in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\
\
Although their kingdom of old has long laid in ruin, freedom may soon be won for all the Stout-axes of Mordor.\
\
You have allowed them to share in this hope and to reunite with their kin in Mordor.","When King Váskmun Greytooth was imprisoned by the Dark Lord, many of his most-trusted kin were brought to the dungeons of Barad-dûr as well.","Imprisoned Stout-axes can be found throughout the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\
\
In your search for King Váskmun Greytooth, you have found other Stout-axes imprisoned in Barad-dûr. You should free them.","Completado","While searching the ruins of Barad-dûr for King Váskmun Greytooth, you have spied several exhausted and plainly-clad Stout-axes held in the smaller cells of the dungeon.\
\
These must be the other Stout-axes that were taken when Sauron imprisoned King Greytooth seventy-eight years ago.\
\
You should free them from the dungeons of Barad-dûr and allow them to reunite with their kin in Lûghash.","Prisoners of the Dark Lord","Free imprisoned Stout-axes from the dungeons of Barad-dûr (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","You have freed all the Stout-axes from the dungeons of Barad-dûr."},
[9800]={"Mincham can be found at Tham Durlan, to the south of Ondoher's Folly in Dagorlad.\
\
You have freed as many of the captives as you were able, and you should now return to Mincham at Tham Durlan.","'Ah! Let us hope we have freed the last of those held in the Wastes, ${PLAYER}! I mourn for those we were too late to save, but I hold hope that the Dark Lord shall soon suffer the fate he deserves for these atrocities.\
\
'I do not doubt the Enemy still keeps many slaves beyond the Black Gate, but we must look to the battle ahead before we can aid them.\
\
'Thank you, my friend.'","If not freed from the clutches of the Enemy, a cruel fate awaits those fallen captive to the Orcs of Mordor in Dagorlad.","Prisoners of the Eye","Talk to Mincham at Tham Durlan","Freed tortured captives at Ondoher's Folly (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Tortured captives can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly in north-western Dagorlad.\
\
Mincham has asked you to aid in freeing the Enemy's captives while you assault the hill of Ondoher's Folly.","Free tortured captives at Ondoher's Folly (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'The Fane of Screaming... what a vile name for a place of such sorrow for the people of Gondor.\
\
'I have heard tales told by Aragorn of the king of old, Ondoher, and the fate that travelled far to meet him in these lands. I believe that is a tale better told by Artamir - and in less pressing times. Suffice it to say, a king of Númenórean blood laid low by the Enemy's servants is not soon to be forgotten. They have twisted the loss of Gondor into a monument to their own Master.\
\
'It is clear that these Orcs have defiled the hill and I fear many of the Dark Lord's prisoners have met their end on its summit - and without the mercy of a swift death. Even in war-time, and with a great battle looming, I cannot abandon those that still remain to such a fate.\
\
'I could not forgive myself for turning away from their pain, ${PLAYER}, and I believe Aragorn would consider this the proper course as well.\
\
'Travel to Ondoher's Folly, and free all of the prisoners you can find. I shall keep watch for your return, my friend!'"},
[9801]={"Prisoners of the Vale","Talk to Melril","Searched for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I know you are no stranger to the troubles we face in the vale, ${PLAYER}. It is for that reason I come to you with this matter....\
\
'More of our hunters have gone missing and it is clear they were taken by force. I fear they have been taken as prisoners in Tarlang's Crown for being so bold as to draw a bow against those that would lay claim to our lands.\
\
'When the time comes, we shall need all who can fight to stand against these foes. Go into the Crown and seek them out... I only hope they still live.'","Melril of Sardol fears for all in the vale who have gone into Tarlang's Crown, and worries that the Corsairs have begun to take prisoners.","Search for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","DNT -- will not be seen","Prisoners from Blackroot Vale can likely be found near the northern end of Tarlang's Crown.\
\
Melril has asked you to search for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown after finding that more people have gone missing from Blackroot Vale.","Melril can be found at the northern end of Tarlang's Crown in Blackroot Vale.\
\
You searched for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown, but only discovered the remains of people of Gondor scattered about their camps. You should speak to Melril.","'I feared this would be the case, ${PLAYER}....\
\
'I thank you for finding them, but it shall not lessen the blow to their families. I will send one of our number to inform them all of what has happened.\
\
'Know this... I intend to see the Corsairs pay for what they have done to us!'"},
[9802]={"Dorset Roblealto te ha guiado hacia la cueva que alguna vez fue la biblioteca de su padre.","'¡Lo encontraste, ! ¡Apenas puedo creerlo! Rápido, ahora — ¿estás ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para irte?'","'En algún lugar dentro de esa biblioteca está el libro que busco, ${PLAYER}. ¡Espero que sepas en qué estantería puede encontrarse, porque los trasgos seguro vendrán a husmear en cualquier momento!'","'¡Salgamos de aquí antes de que los trasgos compliquen aún más las cosas!'","Encuentra la estantería que contiene el libro que Dorset Roblealto está buscando antes de que lleguen los campeones trasgos.","Dorset Roblealto está en la entrada de la cueva.\
\
Dorset está esperando que regreses con el libro que te pidió.","Instancia Privada: Mente Bien Ordenada","¡Demasiado tarde! Han llegado campeones trasgos curtidos en batalla, ¡y debes retirarte!","Esta cueva fue una vez la biblioteca del gran Benton Roblealto, y su sala principal está llena de estanterías.\
\
Dorset Roblealto está esperando que encuentres la estantería que contiene \\qSobre la Resistencia de los Animales en la Naturaleza\\q.","¡Has encontrado el libro que buscaba Dorset Roblealto!"},
[9803]={"'You won't make any coin just standing around! Defeating scather-flies around the groves is what you should be doing.'","Problematic Pests","Assuming you came to her orchard looking for work, Meliri has tasked you with defeating the scather-flies in her orange groves.","Talk to Meliri","Defeated scather-flies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated scather-flies scattered throughout the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl. You should return to Meliri.","You have been asked to defeat scather-flies scattered throughout the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl.","Defeat scather-flies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The flies have been dealt with? Superb. They will probably just come right back, but in the meantime, I have more work for you. Here is the coin I promised.'","'Hashtal-gûr stranger. What could possibly bring a traveller to Ambarûl? Ah, you must be looking for work. You have come to the right place, my friend. We are always short on strong hands. Assuming you know how to use the weapons you carry, I have just the job for you. The biggest threat to our orange groves is insects. By 'big' I mean that literally. There are huge buzzing scather-flies flitting all about the orchard!\
\
'Put those weapons to good use against those flies and I will pay you some coin. Do it well, and I will have more work for you.'"},
[9804]={"'Tus esfuerzos por frenar la propagación de las arañas pueden traer al menos algo de alivio a nuestro dolor. Tienes mi agradecimiento, ${PLAYER}.'","Destruye sacos de huevos en Amon Ros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los huevos de araña se encuentran entre sus nidos en Amon Ros, al oeste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Tras contarte la pérdida de su esposa e hijo a manos de las arañas de Amon Ros, Tortwil te pidió que volvieras al valle y destruyeras cualquier saco de huevos que pudieras encontrar.","Sacos de huevos destruidos en Amon Ros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Por mi palabra, sabe que mi esposa y mi hijo cayeron ante la prole del oeste, pero no fueron los únicos que murieron a manos de las arañas en ese valle. Los Eglain han perdido a tantos a lo largo de los años. Otras familias han perdido hermanos y seres queridos por las arañas y, más recientemente, por los huargos que acechan en lo salvaje.\
\
'Tengo una petición para ti, que puede resultar inútil, pero espero que traiga consuelo a muchos. En Amon Ros, donde habitan las arañas, seguramente viste muchos sacos de huevos. Estos sacos traerán más mal al mundo y el dolor continuará.\
\
'¿Irás y destruirás los huevos antes de que eclosionen? El número de arañas crece cada día, mientras que la buena gente de Ost Guruth disminuye.'","Tortwil espera tu regreso en Ost Guruth, al este de Amon Ros.\
\
Encontraste los sacos de huevos en las sombras de Amon Ros y los destruiste, tal como pidió Tortwil. Debes regresar a Ost Guruth con la noticia de tu éxito.","'Recorre las ruinas de Amon Ros y destruye cualquier saco de huevos que encuentres. La esperanza puede ser escasa, pero al menos podrás ralentizar la expansión de la prole de arañas en Nain Enidh.'","Desde mucho antes de que los orcos y los muertos se arrastraran hacia las Tierras Solitarias, los Eglain han tenido que lidiar con la amenaza de las arañas que habitan en las ruinas a lo largo del solitario tramo de Eriador. Ahora, a medida que las arañas son expulsadas de las profundidades de sus hogares en ruinas, se acercan cada vez más a Ost Guruth y amenazan a los Eglain que viven allí.","Pérdidas profundas"},
[9805]={"Explicas que ser aventurero es un trabajo peligroso, y tarde o temprano tu moral se agotará. Cuando eso ocurra, te encontrarás en uno de los muchos Círculos de Derrota repartidos por la tierra.\
\
'Muy gracioso, ${PLAYERNAME:forastero[m]|forastera[f]}. ¡Sé que luchar es peligroso! Por eso intentaré no enfrentar enemigos que parezcan estar más allá de mis capacidades. Pero a veces es inevitable, supongo... y cuando eso ocurra, si soy derrotado, ¿apareceré en el Círculo de Derrota más cercano al lugar donde caí en combate?'","Meneldir está junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla, junto al cuerpo de Madthrug.\
\
Tras tratar las heridas de algunos residentes de Musgovilla que resultaron heridos durante el ataque, debes regresar con Meneldir y ver qué ha averiguado.","Habla con Tegwyn en el Círculo de Derrota fuera de Musgovilla.","Encuentra el Círculo de Derrota situado al norte de Musgovilla.","'¿Cuál es mi primera lección, ${PLAYERNAME:forastero[m]|forastera[f]}? ¿Qué es lo primero que debo saber para ser un aventurero?'","'Lleva esas vendas y ese ungüento a los residentes heridos cercanos. Espero que sus heridas no sean graves y que estas provisiones alivien su dolor.'","Una multitud de niños se reúne alrededor de Tegwyn y la cruel hoja que ha encontrado.","'Mira esto. El Uruk que lideraba esta banda tiene algo en la mano. Intenta arrancárselo.'","'Eso está muy bien, pero ¡quiero golpear algo!'","'¿Un trozo de pergamino? Será mejor que lo leas, ${PLAYER}. Quizá nos diga por qué este Uruk lideró su incursión contra Musgovilla.'","Skardí asiente cuando entras en su tienda.","Trata las heridas de los residentes heridos de Musgovilla (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Muy gracioso.'","'¡Ahora esto sí que me gusta!'","'Veamos si este pergamino nos da alguna pista.'\
\
Meneldir estudia brevemente el pergamino arrugado, pero luego levanta la vista, decepcionado.\
\
'No puedo leer mucho de esto. Si este fuera un día normal, me alegraría no tener motivo para entender la Lengua Negra... pero hoy es motivo de frustración.\
\
'Espera, ${PLAYER}. ¿Qué ha pasado con la espada de este Uruk? No cayó lejos de su cuerpo, a menos que mis ojos me engañen.'","'¿A dónde ahora?' pregunta Tegwyn.","Tegwyn está dentro de la herrería en Musgovilla.","Recupera el pequeño objeto que Madthrug sostiene en su mano.","'¡Skardí pasa más tiempo arreglando herraduras que forjando espadas!'","Has tratado a los residentes heridos de Musgovilla (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. La gente de Musgovilla a veces menosprecia a los Montaraces que fueron mis parientes, pero sí aceptan su ayuda cuando se les ofrece. Mi antiguo capitán, Trancos, dice que la desconfianza de esta gente no le molesta, pero si eso es cierto, es mejor hombre que yo.'\
\
Una expresión dolorida cruza el rostro de Meneldir.\
\
'Eso es cierto por muchas razones, ${PLAYER}. Hace tiempo que no llamo a los Dúnedain mi familia, pero nunca cuestionaría la integridad ni el valor de Trancos.\
\
'Pero mira esto. El Uruk que lideraba esta banda tiene algo en la mano. Intenta arrancárselo.'","Prólogo, Capítulo 1: Algo Diferente","Los residentes heridos de Musgovilla se encuentran tendidos en el suelo cerca de aquí.\
\
Meneldir te dio un suministro de ungüentos y vendas con los que puedes tratar las heridas de los residentes heridos de Musgovilla.","El Círculo de Derrota más cercano está al norte de Musgovilla.\
\
Has aceptado (a regañadientes) enseñar a Tegwyn algunas lecciones básicas de aventura, y... ¿qué mejor lugar para empezar que el Círculo de Derrota local?","Habla con Meneldir junto al cuerpo de Madthrug.","Escuchas los gritos y exclamaciones emocionadas de los niños al noroeste.","Tegwyn observa el Círculo de Derrota. '¿Qué es esto?', te pregunta.","Una ruidosa multitud de niños se ha reunido al noroeste en Musgovilla. ¿Qué los tiene tan emocionados?","'Algunos residentes de Musgovilla sufrieron heridas que no podemos sanar, y están más allá de nuestra ayuda. Los lloraremos más tarde, pero ahora debemos centrarnos en aquellos a quienes aún podemos ayudar.'\
\
Meneldir te entrega un pequeño paquete de vendas y una bolsa con ungüento de olor amargo.\
\
'Esto es lo último de mis provisiones, pero no hay razón para guardarlas para otro día. Lleva estas vendas y este ungüento a los residentes heridos cercanos. Espero que sus heridas no sean graves y que esto alivie su dolor.'","'¿Qué quieres, ${PLAYERNAME:forastero[m]|forastera[f]}? No, ¡no te daré esta espada! Es mucho mejor que la espada de madera que usaba antes. La encontré y ahora me pertenece. Mi padre dice que cuando estás en una batalla, te quedas con el botín, ¡y yo me enfrenté a esos Uruks incluso cuando la guardia del pueblo no lo hizo! Si alguien debería quedarse con la espada del Uruk, ¡soy yo!\
\
'Bueno... espera un momento. Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un aventurero[m]|una aventurera[f]}, ¿verdad? Si prometes ayudarme a entrenar en las artes de la aventura, quizá te dé la espada. No digo que lo haré, ¿entiendes? Digo que QUIZÁ. Dependerá de lo bueno que sea tu entrenamiento.\
\
'¿Cuál es mi primera lección, ${PLAYERNAME:forastero[m]|forastera[f]}? ¿Qué es lo primero que debo saber para ser un aventurero?'","Este muñeco de entrenamiento ha visto su buena parte de batallas.","Un muñeco de entrenamiento situado justo fuera de la herrería en Musgovilla satisfará el entusiasmo de Tegwyn por el combate.","Entra en la herrería de Musgovilla y enseña a Tegwyn su utilidad.","Arrancas un trozo de pergamino del agarre mortal del Uruk.","'¡Ja! ¡Yah! ¡Toma eso, villanos!'","Tegwyn está junto al Círculo de Derrota fuera de Musgovilla.","Madthrug, el líder de la partida Uruk, podría tener alguna pista sobre su propósito al atacar Musgovilla.","La herrería está en Musgovilla y es un lugar importante para los aventureros que buscan comprar nuevo equipo o reparar el viejo.","La gente de Musgovilla necesita tu ayuda para recuperarse de los daños causados por el reciente ataque Uruk contra su aldea.","Lee el trozo de pergamino que tomaste del cuerpo de Madthrug.","Habla con Tegwyn dentro de la herrería en Musgovilla.","Meneldir espera que le muestres el trozo de pergamino que recuperaste del cuerpo de Madthrug.","Tomaste un pequeño trozo de pergamino del cuerpo de Madthrug. ¿Qué secretos guarda?","Habla con Tegwyn","'Creo que tenemos nuestra respuesta, ${PLAYER}. Si uno de esos niños ha tomado la espada del Uruk, será mejor que la recuperes antes de que el niño se haga daño con ella.'","'El equipo es importante,' admite Tegwyn, 'pero ¡quiero golpear algo!'","Tegwyn sonríe con picardía. 'Bueno, ¿vas a enseñarme o no?', te pregunta.","Parece que Tegwyn se ha llevado la cruel hoja que una vez blandió Madthrug.\
\
Tegwyn podría lastimarse a sí mismo o a alguien más si no logras quitarle el arma.","Tegwyn está junto al muñeco de entrenamiento en Musgovilla, ansioso por aprender más sobre aventura y combate.","Entrega el trozo de pergamino a Meneldir","'¿Cuál es mi próxima lección de aventurero? ¡Y que sea buena!'","Encuentra el muñeco de entrenamiento situado fuera de la herrería en Musgovilla.","'¡Skardí pasa más tiempo arreglando herraduras que forjando espadas! No quiero ofenderte, Skardí, ¡pero es verdad! ¿Qué utilidad tiene una tienda así para un aventurero?'\
\
Explicas que cuando un aventurero combate, las armas y armaduras equipadas sufren daño de durabilidad, y gente como Skardí Doblafilos puede repararlas para que sigas usándolas. Además, los comerciantes de toda la Tierra Media pueden vender al aventurero todo tipo de objetos y equipo que le ayudarán en sus viajes.\
\
Skardí carraspea y habla: Todo eso cuesta monedas, joven Tegwyn, ¡herraduras y espadas por igual! Pero si esta incursión es señal de lo que viene, creo que las espadas se volverán más demandadas que nunca.","Investiga qué ha emocionado tanto a los niños al noroeste, en Musgovilla.","Habla con Tegwyn en el muñeco de entrenamiento en Musgovilla"},
[9806]={"Tegwyn aceptó entregar la espada Uruk si logras impresionarlo con una demostración de tu habilidad en combate.","'Eso estuvo decente, supongo.'\
\
Tegwyn lucha por ocultar cualquier muestra de emoción.\
\
'¡Una más! Muéstrame una habilidad más, ¡y que sea increíble!'\
\
<rgb=#00CCCC>PISTA</rgb>: Pulsa la tecla J para abrir el panel de rasgos. Elige una especialización para tu clase y obtendrás nuevas habilidades y destrezas. No te preocupes, siempre podrás cambiar tu decisión más adelante.\
\
Después de elegir una especialización, usa <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Implacable</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Defensa Súbita</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Tormenta de Espadas</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres tu habilidad en combate usando <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Lleva la espada Uruk a Meneldir junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.","Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Eso estuvo bastante bien, supongo...\
\
'¡Bien! Has cumplido tu parte del trato, ${PLAYER}, y yo cumpliré la mía. Aquí tienes el arma de Madthrug, como prometí. ¿La llevarás de vuelta con ese Montaraz por mí? Madre y padre estarán complacidos, pero sigo pensando que podría haber manejado un arma así.'","Has demostrado cómo desatar la <rgb=#ffff00>Furia</rgb> de un Campeón usando la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb>. ¿Te entregará Tegwyn la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","'Bueno, estoy listo para que me muestres tus habilidades de combate... y si me impresionas, te daré esta espada Uruk. ¡Será mejor que sea una buena demostración, o el trato se acaba!'\
\
Explicas que los Campeones dependen de la <rgb=#ffff00>Furia</rgb> para usar sus habilidades más poderosas. Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> para generar <rgb=#ffff00>Furia</rgb>.\
\
'Interesante. ¡Veamos! Para eso está este muñeco de entrenamiento, después de todo.'","Prólogo, Capítulo 2: Habilidades de un Aventurero","Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento","'Bueno, estoy listo para que me muestres tus habilidades de combate... y si me impresionas, te daré esta espada Uruk. ¡Será mejor que sea una buena demostración, o el trato se acaba!'\
\
Explicas que los Campeones dependen de la <rgb=#ffff00>Furia</rgb> para usar sus habilidades más poderosas. Usa tu habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb>Ataque salvaje para generar <rgb=#ffff00>Furia</rgb>.\
\
'Interesante. ¡Veamos! Para eso está este muñeco de entrenamiento, después de todo.'","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Tegwyn junto al muñeco de entrenamiento.","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Implacable</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Defensa Súbita</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Tormenta de Espadas</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","'Has cumplido tu parte del trato, ${PLAYER}, y yo también. Ahora lleva esa espada al Montaraz antes de que cambie de opinión. Sigo pensando que podría haberla manejado.'","Tegwyn te entrega a regañadientes la espada del Uruk.","Has demostrado un ataque básico de Campeón a Tegwyn. ¿Te entregará la espada del Uruk, como acordó?","Meneldir está junto a la puerta este de Musgovilla.\
\
Ahora que has recuperado la espada Uruk, debes llevarla a Meneldir.","'¿Recuperaste la espada Uruk de Tegwyn antes de que se lastimara con ella? Muy bien hecho, ${PLAYER}.'\
\
Meneldir fija la mirada en la distancia, sobre el muro que rodea Musgovilla.\
\
'Recuerdo tener esa edad y soñar solo con aventuras, con emoción. No era tan diferente del joven Tegwyn cuando era un niño creciendo en el Ángulo del Mitheithel, donde habita mi gente. No lo juzgo con dureza por tomar la espada, y espero que tú tampoco lo hagas. Sus padres están ocupados trabajando en las defensas de Musgovilla, y me atrevo a decir que no saben nada de las travesuras del muchacho. No se lo diré si tú tampoco, ${PLAYER}.'","'Eso estuvo bien, supongo. Pero seguro que tienes ataques más poderosos a tu disposición.'\
\
Explicas que un Campeón puede usar su <rgb=#ffff00>Furia</rgb> para desatar ataques aún más poderosos.\
\
'¡Vaya, quiero ver eso!'\
\
<rgb=#00CCCC>PISTA</rgb>:\
Genera <rgb=#ffff00>Furia</rgb> y luego usa la habilidad <rgb=#00ff00>Golpes Feroces</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Has usado <rgb=#00ff00>Golpe Implacable</rgb>, <rgb=#00ff00>Defensa Súbita</rgb> o <rgb=#00ff00>Tormenta de Espadas</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento","Usa <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento.","Tegwyn espera que demuestres tu habilidad en combate usando <rgb=#00ff00>Ataque salvaje</rgb> en el muñeco de entrenamiento."},
